    "scenesThatPass": [
      "WATTERS: Three hours t'the east. S'day trip. Pretty this time a'year too...\nSYKES: We gotta lay something out, strategy- wise. Somethin' tight. Y'go in there ad-libbing, it's y'ass.\nWATTERS: What are we talkin' on the split...",
      "SYKES: No, we're not together.\nWATTERS: C'mon baby, don't be shy.\nWATTERS: Just one bed please. Although if we sweat that one up, we goin' need some clean sheets. C'mon Girl, you know I'm playing!\nWATTERS: ..If ya'll let hoochie like that stay up in here, ya'll must be burning sheets by the ton.",
      "SYKES: ...Faggot-ass redneck...\nWATTERS: What'd you say?\nSYKES: Not you. Some assholes on the elevator...are these bitches on a permanent smoke break or what? Why the fuck they call'm \"working girls.\"\nWATTERS: Alright, the ho train is exiting the station. They're coming to you...",
      "WATTERS: What is it...?\nSYKES: ...Shhhhhhit...girl, there's these two dudes, just sittin' here in this elevator, all shot up...\nWATTERS: What?\nSYKES: They musta been beefin' big time with one another, cuz this shit, got way past words, whatever it was.",
      "SYKES: Are these feds fake or for real girl!\nWATTERS: I DON'T KNOW!\nSYKES: Jus' keep doin' y'damage girl, keep these mafuckas off my as--\nSYKES: We're out girl! I'm shot! I'M SHOT!--"
    ]
  },
